  "reactionOrdering": {
    "priorityBarrier": {
      "priorityClass": "critical_progression",
      "priority": 100,
      "delivery": "latched",
      "blocking": true,
      "maxShows": 1
    },
    "exactOrder": [
      "Duty command commits and increments palaceDutyCount.",
      "If threshold reached, Palace career stage transitions immediately in the same command.",
      "At duty 15 only, that final transition writes palace.progression-complete exactly once.",
      "The resulting careerTransition reaction selects the one matching latched milestone event for the new stage.",
      "While the milestone event is pending, the new stage/counter (and progression-complete at duty 15) are already serialized; no duty or transition is replayed on reload.",
      "Player resolves the milestone event; its continue choice adds the stage-local milestone-XX-resolved Palace career fact.",
      "Stage-specific optional relationships/Night/outcome-prep/events may require the resolved fact, so they cannot overtake the milestone barrier.",
      "Normal/optional Palace surfaces may resolve only after the milestone barrier is cleared."
    ],
    "stageAttachmentBarrierFacts": {
