      "outcome-ready": "milestone-15-resolved"
    },
    "finalMilestoneNote": "palace.progression-complete is present while milestone-15 is pending, but the blocking pending scene prevents the player from starting a Prince confrontation or committing an ending until the milestone scene is resolved."
